Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:07.73,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Even though we all want to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.19,0:23:14.97,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re being deceived by gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:23.14,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}In reality, everybody can already fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.54,0:23:31.75,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}The reason why that child looks so sad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:42.72,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}might be because she left her shadow somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.23,0:23:45.41,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.89,0:23:49.98,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}If telling you "Thank you",
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:53.95,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}or hearing "Thank you" just makes you smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:24:01.13,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}then doing those things will make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.51,0:24:05.75,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}And the{\fsp3}y{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}ll make you happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:14.58,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}Do{\fsp1}n{\fsp0}'{\fsp0}t worry, w{\fsp3}e{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}re together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.42,0:24:19.90,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\pos(360,460)\fad(200,200)}I{\fsp3}t{\fsp-4}'{\fsp0}s mysterious as to why tears roll down
