Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.57,0:00:08.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.88,0:00:12.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Making decorations out of this pretty paper!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.28,0:00:15.12,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If I remember correctly, those\Npapers are from the landlady's...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:15.12,0:00:19.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Chitose received a lot as a present from the bookstore,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,so she told me to give it to the Nursery.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.79,0:00:26.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make a lot of decorations like this and hang them on the walls and windows!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:26.20,0:00:29.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think they will like it?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.05,0:00:31.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They'll probably be annoyed, actually.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.19,0:00:35.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Let me give you some advice.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What you have there is called origami paper.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.94,0:00:40.71,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Normally, you play with it by folding it!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.37,0:00:46.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,W-What should I do, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.65,0:00:49.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't... I can't make it go back!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.78,0:00:51.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.95,0:00:56.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way to undo what you did!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:44.54,0:02:45.92,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:45.92,0:02:47.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:47.25,0:02:47.77,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.16,0:02:50.32,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't get very much sleep, did you?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.77,0:02:52.21,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I can tell from your face.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.21,0:02:53.52,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Now see here.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.99,0:02:57.07,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You can't go around saying such things about women's faces!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.28,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You'll hurt their feelings.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:58.28,0:02:59.74,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't a joke—!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.90,0:03:05.20,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring this to the office.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:06.58,0:03:07.81,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Please and thank you!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:16.38,0:03:18.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um... Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.95,0:03:21.20,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.46,0:03:25.50,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What on earth are you apologizing for?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.50,0:03:30.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose said to give this to everyone at the Nursery.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.95,0:03:33.47,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's origami paper.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:33.47,0:03:34.86,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,And so much of it too!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.09,0:03:38.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, there was even more than that,
Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.23,0:03:41.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,but I didn't know origami paper was supposed to be folded
Dialogue: 5,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,and I did something I shouldn't have...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.61,0:03:45.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:51.81,0:03:53.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:55.79,0:03:57.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:59.05,0:04:00.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.39,0:04:01.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.94,0:04:02.80,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:02.80,0:04:04.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka is—
Dialogue: 5,0:04:08.07,0:04:09.21,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:09.21,0:04:10.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get you to a hospital immediately.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:11.67,0:04:12.84,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine, really.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.84,0:04:14.98,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way you could be fine after collapsing like that!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:15.61,0:04:18.28,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Really. If I just rest for a bit...
Dialogue: 5,0:04:18.85,0:04:20.23,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:20.57,0:04:22.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd rather see a doctor, I know one!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.69,0:04:24.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get him immediately!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.89,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.89,0:04:35.00,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.15,0:04:50.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.01,0:04:52.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.22,0:04:53.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please open the door!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.58,0:04:56.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please open the door!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:56.05,0:04:57.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is anyone there?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.47,0:04:59.77,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:59.77,0:05:00.98,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is Shuichiro here?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.86,0:05:08.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please help me! Miss Sayaka is—!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.58,0:05:29.98,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter with Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:30.54,0:05:32.89,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing you guys need to worry about.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:39.32,0:05:40.54,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How is she?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:40.54,0:05:45.04,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,She's fatigued from lack of sleep and has a light case of gastric inflammation.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:45.83,0:05:47.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.31,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,I'll prescribe medicine for her.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:50.72,0:05:54.70,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,After she rests and settles down, have her eat something easily digestible.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.06,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for bothering you so suddenly.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.46,0:06:01.99,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it. I'm glad I happened to be on break.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.99,0:06:03.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.21,0:06:05.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is Miss Sayaka okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.43,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,If she continues to go on like this,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:09.43,0:06:11.64,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,it won't be long before her condition is much worse than just collapsing.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:13.40,0:06:16.02,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be a good idea not to\Nthink of this as just fatigue.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.05,0:06:19.47,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell this to her too.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.86,0:06:20.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.87,0:06:24.30,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, take care.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.18,0:06:34.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know him?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.76,0:06:35.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:35.68,0:06:36.97,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That doctor.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:37.53,0:06:40.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He lives together with Kohaku...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:40.43,0:06:41.36,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.75,0:06:43.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, the one from last time...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:43.67,0:06:44.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.65,0:06:58.43,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.74,0:07:03.48,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Is Miss Sayaka sick?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:06.51,0:07:07.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She's okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.87,0:07:09.03,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:09.38,0:07:10.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Really.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.31,0:07:13.09,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,She'll get better soon. Even the doctor said so.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.40,0:07:21.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you guys go around acting all upset,\NMiss Sayaka will get worried, won't she?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.51,0:07:29.55,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Let's all sing together energetically and help Miss Sayaka get better, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.89,0:07:32.09,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.98,0:07:47.35,Insert,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Underneath the blue, blue sky,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:47.35,0:07:52.46,Insert,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,in the valley...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.41,0:07:47.35,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That Kobato, she completely forgot about me.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.29,0:08:10.71,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.89,0:08:17.47,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you silently stay by her side like that,\Ndo you think Miss Sayaka will get better?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... just a little longer...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.88,0:08:22.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:22.69,0:08:26.94,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of doing this, wouldn't\Ntaking good care of the children
Dialogue: 5,0:08:26.94,0:08:30.32,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,let Miss Sayaka rest much more easily?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.80,0:08:35.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose you're right...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.26,0:08:47.37,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,How was the patient?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.37,0:08:48.69,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,She's settled down.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.07,0:08:51.46,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.46,0:08:52.65,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:53.01,0:08:56.87,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,If you do this... then this...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.87,0:08:58.64,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,You get a samurai's attendant!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.12,0:09:04.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So that's how you play with origami.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.83,0:09:09.27,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Look here, look here, Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:09.62,0:09:10.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.62,0:09:12.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A balloon?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:12.80,0:09:15.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What are you folding over there, Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:15.36,0:09:17.20,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Cranes!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Cranes?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.59,0:09:20.28,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,They're a type of bird.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's a bird!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.47,0:09:26.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're folding a lot of them, aren't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.50,0:09:27.92,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. A thousand of them!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:28.18,0:09:29.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A thousand?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.67,0:09:35.62,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. So Miss Sayaka will hurry up and get better.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.57,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,If you fold a thousand cranes, you can make sick people get better.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.57,0:09:39.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:39.98,0:09:43.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please teach me how to fold cranes too!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.56,0:09:44.97,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fold cranes too!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.97,0:09:46.38,Default,Yuzuru,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.38,0:09:47.41,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.41,0:09:49.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's all fold cranes together!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.77,0:09:52.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like... like this?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.65,0:09:54.11,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Like this, see...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.05,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.47,0:10:00.18,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,It's difficult, isn't it...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.96,0:10:02.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So it's like that...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.99,0:10:03.70,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, you did it!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:08.28,0:10:09.71,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You did it!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.37,0:10:22.11,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think she'll be okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.11,0:10:23.24,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, I mean.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.86,0:10:26.29,Default,Shinichiro,0000,0000,0000,,You're worrying about the wrong person, aren't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.29,0:10:27.81,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, really?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:27.81,0:10:29.28,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:29.92,0:10:36.23,Default,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,But... I don't know why, but I'm concerned for Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.87,0:10:45.83,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Will Miss Sayaka be better tomorrow?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everything'll be okay!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We managed to fold a thousand cranes after all!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.96,0:10:51.92,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:01.62,0:11:04.76,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,All right... I'll try to come back from work as soon as I can,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.18,0:11:07.99,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll be counting on you to take care of Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.46,0:11:09.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:10.99,0:11:13.22,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If anything happens, contact me immediately.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.07,0:11:49.88,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Manager, there's a favor I want to ask of you...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.88,0:11:51.72,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,What's up? Why the formality?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:52.71,0:11:56.77,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I was wondering if I could have less hours for a little while.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.77,0:11:57.38,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.98,0:11:59.69,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you need money?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:59.69,0:12:01.95,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I do, but...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:03.30,0:12:04.45,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, there's something more important...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.38,0:12:07.70,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,I got it.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.20,0:12:12.80,Default,Tenchou,0000,0000,0000,,In exchange, I'm gonna work you hard when you're free again!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:12.80,0:12:14.02,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize for this.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:14.02,0:12:15.37,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.46,0:12:28.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.18,0:12:30.35,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:32.33,0:12:34.54,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been watching over me this whole time?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.54,0:12:35.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:36.76,0:12:38.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What about the children?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.15,0:12:42.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Their parents have all come to pick them up and everyone's gone home now.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.86,0:12:44.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.05,0:12:46.78,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for worrying you like this.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.16,0:12:48.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please keep resting!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.69,0:12:57.04,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I was planning on putting up a good fight too... {I was planning on fighting it off as long as I could too...}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.04,0:12:57.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:58.98,0:13:00.98,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,But then you showed up to help out...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.98,0:13:05.22,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,And with both you and Fujimoto here, I suppose I felt at ease
Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.22,0:13:07.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,and thought that it would be okay to just leave things to the two of you...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.38,0:13:14.12,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,If something does end up happening to me...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:15.82,0:13:17.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.98,0:13:21.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why... would you...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.47,0:13:25.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If something were to ever\Nhappen to you, Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.82,0:13:29.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone would be so sad.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.13,0:13:35.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why... That's why you\Nabsolutely talk like that!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.87,0:13:42.50,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:58.88,0:14:01.28,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Things are done here for today. Go home.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.27,0:14:03.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.44,0:14:05.57,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're already a space case.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.99,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you were to get even more\Nspaced out due to a lack of sleep,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.46,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'd be in trouble, wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:09.46,0:14:10.53,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Space case?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.80,0:14:12.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a space case!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:12.85,0:14:15.12,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take over for you from here, so go home.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.36,0:14:19.26,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're no help to anyone if your mind is somewhere else.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.26,0:14:20.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I said I'm not—
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.55,0:14:21.72,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and get going.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.85,0:14:29.55,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She scolded me.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.02,0:14:32.48,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What she said was right.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.93,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.93,0:14:36.00,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Things really are as she said.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:37.26,0:14:40.06,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,The kids all worked together to fold those.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.43,0:14:41.51,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.22,0:14:47.11,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Here are the ones she made.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.04,0:14:49.61,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,The ones over here are all like this.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.11,0:14:53.62,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She's such a good kid, isn't she?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.86,0:14:57.82,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. {kyaaaa~}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.09,0:15:21.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you really that worried about Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.52,0:15:24.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.74,0:15:26.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.08,0:15:30.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.82,0:15:40.26,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be that her lost memories have returned?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.74,0:15:43.19,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.19,0:15:45.00,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,What's the answer to number seven?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.80,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no! You don't know either, Chise?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.76,0:15:51.83,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.30,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.30,0:15:56.72,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.72,0:15:59.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is Chitose here?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.64,0:16:03.23,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Mama's at the neighborhood\Nassociation meeting right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.23,0:16:04.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.95,0:16:05.86,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.86,0:16:08.00,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,You look down, Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To tell you the truth... it's an illness!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.13,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.25,0:16:23.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,N-Not me!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.85,0:16:24.62,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.10,0:16:28.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miss Sayaka who's sick.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.97,0:16:37.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to do something to help Miss\NSayaka, but I don't know what I should do.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.67,0:16:38.76,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,We see, we see.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.09,0:16:42.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I helped to fold a thousand cranes along with the kids at the Nursery, but...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.87,0:16:44.30,Default,C&C,0000,0000,0000,,A thousand cranes!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:44.30,0:16:45.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.57,0:16:48.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I wasn't really good at folding them...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.22,0:16:53.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What if our wish isn't able to come true because of my badly folded cranes?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:53.84,0:16:55.80,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.37,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure your wish will come true, Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:00.11,0:17:02.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I really hope so...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.74,0:17:04.99,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! What about that thing?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.99,0:17:05.52,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.52,0:17:09.17,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,You know, the thing that Mama\Nalways makes for us when we get sick!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.32,0:17:11.45,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Um...rice porridge?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.45,0:17:12.86,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, rice porridge!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.86,0:17:14.31,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,I get it! Rice porridge!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:14.31,0:17:15.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:15.34,0:17:20.67,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Mama said rice porridge is easy to digest so it's easy on your stomach when you're sick.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Easy to digest?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:22.42,0:17:24.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro said the same thing!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.85,0:17:28.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He said to have Miss Sayaka eat something easily digestible!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.23,0:17:31.24,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, why don't you make some rice porridge for her?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.86,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it'll help Miss Sayaka get better!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.86,0:17:37.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'll make some rice porridge for Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.58,0:17:40.87,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But how should I make that...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.87,0:17:43.38,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,How about we draw a picture for her, Chiho?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.38,0:17:44.87,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Good idea, Chise!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.35,0:17:50.46,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,It's something like this...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.78,0:17:53.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So this is rice porridge!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.87,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,It's white...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.87,0:17:57.00,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,And kind of gooey!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.29,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:58.29,0:18:00.61,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,G-o-o-e-y!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.01,0:18:05.82,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Mama said you'll burn yourself if\Nyou're not careful when you eat i!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.82,0:18:07.80,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,H-o-t!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.80,0:18:11.52,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,And when you make it, you add lots and lots of water!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.93,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,D-r-e-n-c-h!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.93,0:18:17.37,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is this really going to turn out okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.33,0:18:57.29,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.99,0:19:05.45,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.21,0:19:09.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was trying to make rice porridge...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.06,0:19:15.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I had Chiho and Chise go through the trouble of teaching me,
Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.95,0:19:18.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't get it right...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.05,0:19:21.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Rice porridge is supposedly easy to digest.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:22.23,0:19:24.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I thought I'd make some for Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:29.48,0:19:32.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,After you put in the rice, add in plenty of water.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.26,0:19:36.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Then wait until it mixes all\Ntogether and comes to a boil.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.15,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,After that, simmer it for a bit on a low fire and you're done.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:40.21,0:19:43.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, how did you brew up that concoction?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.12,0:19:48.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you made someone eat that, even an illness that was about to get better would just get worse.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.31,0:19:58.92,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:59.68,0:20:03.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If Miss Sayaka dies...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:08.53,0:20:11.98,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine. People don't die that easily.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Some do!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.63,0:20:22.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Some people really do die just\Nbecause of some tiny, little thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.99,0:20:26.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Did that happen to someone?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.49,0:20:33.69,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:34.70,0:20:37.09,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka won't die.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:48.53,0:20:49.67,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:56.75,0:20:58.41,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.41,0:20:59.94,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be healthy in no time!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.16,0:21:02.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.99,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I might even overeat. {want to be a pig and eat more than i should actually...}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:06.36,0:21:07.54,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's really good!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.92,0:21:10.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy that I could be of help to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.36,0:21:13.25,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I was the one who did just about everything.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:13.25,0:21:15.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-That's true... but...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:15.93,0:21:17.64,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,But what?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.42,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.71,0:21:20.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.90,0:21:30.63,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You haven't gotten any.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.63,0:21:31.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.67,0:21:35.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Staring at them like that\Nwon't create more konpeito.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.38,0:21:36.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.01,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.10,0:21:39.98,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You seem rather happy after hearing that. {literally, not depressed}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.46,0:21:42.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.23,0:21:45.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.11,0:21:46.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:47.41,0:21:52.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,At that time, when I just broke\Ndown and cried in front of Fujimoto,
Dialogue: 5,0:21:52.45,0:21:57.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,something heavy that had been twisted up inside of me seemed to come loose and...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:59.39,0:22:02.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Turned into an extremely warm feeling.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.70,0:22:08.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're the one who's supposed to be healing people, but instead, you get healed yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.09,0:22:08.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are we going to do with you?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.67,0:22:12.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I... was healed?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.75,0:22:16.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.81,0:22:22.95,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:22.95,0:22:24.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:25.08,0:22:25.69,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:25.69,0:22:27.69,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:28.06,0:22:29.08,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:29.08,0:22:30.98,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:30.98,0:22:31.70,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.70,0:22:34.11,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all better now, Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:34.11,0:22:35.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm all right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.45,0:22:38.49,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Our thousand cranes must have worked!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:38.88,0:22:41.01,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:41.01,0:22:43.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
